<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Import Attendance - TLMPS</title>
  <style>
    body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f4f0fa;color:#1e1b26;margin:0}.top{background:#3b1c56;color:#fff;padding:20px 6%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.top a{color:#fff}.wrap{max-width:760px;margin:35px auto;padding:0 20px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2d4f0;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px #3b1c5612}.notice{background:#eff6ff;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;padding:14px;line-height:1.5;margin:18px 0}.warning{background:#fffbeb;border-left:4px solid #d97706;padding:14px;line-height:1.5;margin:18px 0}input{display:block;margin:18px 0;max-width:100%}button{background:#5c2d91;border:0;border-radius:7px;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding:12px 18px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="top"><strong>TLMPS Attendance Transfer</strong><a href="/superadmin/attendance">← Attendance</a></header>
  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="card">
      <h1>Import local attendance</h1>
      <p>Choose the attendance-only JSON export made from the computer where attendance was marked.</p>
      <div class="notice">This file contains only attendance plus the minimal roster fields (admission number, name, class, department, gender) and session enrollments for students referenced by those attendance records. It does not contain passwords, contact information, NIN, or LASSRA.</div>
      <div class="warning">Existing Render students, enrollments, and attendance are never overwritten. Only missing records are added. All sessions and terms must already exist on Render; if they do not match, the whole import is rejected without changes.</div>
      <form method="POST" action="/superadmin/attendance/import" enctype="multipart/form-data">
        <input type="hidden" name="token" value="<%= token %>">
        <input type="file" name="attendanceFile" accept=".json,application/json" required>
        <button type="submit">Import attendance</button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
